"The spectrogram's color map. Theme follows the app's palette. Heat turns from indigo through crimson to amber as the level rises, so nearby levels are easier to tell apart. Gray is plain grayscale." = "频谱图的配色。主题跟随应用的调色板。热度随电平升高由靛蓝经深红变为琥珀色，相近的电平更容易区分。灰度为纯黑白。";
"A display slope around 1 kHz for the spectrum and the spectrogram. Music falls by about 3 to 4.5 dB per octave, so a tilt shows a balanced mix as level and the treble as clearly as the bass. Readings stay true." = "以 1 kHz 为支点，为频谱和声谱图加上显示斜率。音乐的能量通常每倍频程下降约 3 到 4.5 dB，加上斜率后，平衡的混音会显示得大致水平，高频细节也和低频一样清楚。读数保持真实值。";
