"2D scrolls a flat image in time. 3D lifts it into a landscape: time across, frequency into the distance, level as height." = "2D 以平面图像随时间滚动。3D 将其立成地形：横向为时间，纵深为频率，高度为电平。";
"A faint line along each band's recent peak, held 1.2 s and then falling." = "沿每个频段最近的峰值画一条淡线，保持 1.2 秒后回落。";
"Averages the curve, the peak holds and the average across frequency, in power. 1/6 octave reads like a mixing engineer's analyser; 1/3 octave shows the broad tonal balance; Off draws every band. Var keeps 1/48 octave detail up to 100 Hz and widens to 1/3 octave from 10 kHz, as room-measurement software does." = "在频率方向上按功率平均曲线、峰值保持和平均曲线。1/6 倍频程接近混音工程师常用的分析仪；1/3 倍频程显示整体音色平衡；关闭则绘制每个频段。 Var 在 100 Hz 以下保留 1/48 倍频程的细节，并在 10 kHz 以上放宽到 1/3 倍频程，与房间测量软件的做法相同。";
"Classic shows every row at its calibrated level. Enhanced moves each component's energy to the time and frequency its phase points to (reassignment): tones become thin lines and onsets sharp, while noise breaks into fine grain." = "经典模式按校准电平显示每一行。增强模式依据相位把每个成分的能量移到其所在的时间与频率（时频重分配）：音高成为细线，起音更清晰，噪声则呈细碎颗粒。";
