"Between speakers: phantom image" = "扬声器之间：幻象声像";
"Ochre: out of phase" = "赭色：反相";
"Between speakers: phantom image · Ochre: out of phase" = "扬声器之间：幻象声像 · 赭色：反相";
"RADIUS = LEVEL" = "半径 = 电平";
"Radius = level, %@ to 0 dBFS" = "半径 = 电平，%@ 至 0 dBFS";
"Level floor" = "电平下限";
"How much the body covers what lies behind it." = "能量体遮盖其后方内容的程度。";
"How quickly the body grows toward a new level." = "能量体向新电平扩张的速度。";
"How quickly the body shrinks when the level drops." = "电平下降时能量体收缩的速度。";
"How much every lobe is widened beyond the width it is predicted to be heard at, so the body reads as one mass (degrees at half maximum). At 30°, two uncorrelated speakers 60° apart still show as two lobes, while one coherent image between them shows as one." = "每个波瓣在预测的听感宽度之外再加宽多少，使能量体读作一个整体（半峰全宽，单位为度）。在 30° 时，相距 60° 的两只不相关扬声器仍显示为两个波瓣，而它们之间的一个相干声像显示为一个波瓣。";
"The LFE channel's level as the arc around the listener, on the body's scale: it has no direction, so it never shapes the body. Low frequencies in the full-range channels stay where those channels are." = "LFE 声道的电平显示为听者周围的弧线，与能量体同一刻度：它没有方向，因此从不改变能量体的形状。全频声道中的低频仍留在这些声道所在的位置。";
"The hemisphere's grid and the level rings on the floor, every 20 dB, labelled in dBFS." = "半球网格与地面上的电平环，每 20 dB 一环，以 dBFS 标注。";
"The level at the listener, where the body's radius starts: quieter energy reaches no radius. The speakers' shell is 0 dBFS." = "听者处的电平，即能量体半径的起点：更安静的能量不形成半径。扬声器所在的球壳为 0 dBFS。";
"Spatial energy body of the speaker feeds. Its radius in each direction is the level heard from there, from %@ dBFS at the listener to 0 dBFS at the speakers, not a distance. Energy several speakers carry coherently points between them; energy out of phase is tinted ochre. Height channels use a schematic 45 degree elevation." = "扬声器馈送信号的空间能量体。它在每个方向上的半径是从该方向听到的电平，从听者处的 %@ dBFS 到扬声器处的 0 dBFS，并非距离。多只扬声器相干承载的能量指向它们之间；反相的能量染为赭色。顶部声道采用示意性的 45 度仰角。";
"The body shows how loud the speaker feeds are heard from each direction: its radius is the level in dBFS (the rings on the floor), not a distance. Energy only one speaker carries points at that speaker. Energy several speakers carry coherently points between them, where its phantom image is heard: along their velocity vector below about 700 Hz and their energy vector above (Gerzon), as wide as the energy vector predicts it is heard (Frank). Energy that cancels between speakers has no stable direction: it spreads wide and is tinted ochre. An estimate from the feeds, not a measured sound field; height channels use a schematic 45 degree elevation. Hover over the body to read a direction's level and what forms it." = "能量体显示从每个方向听到的扬声器馈送信号有多响：它的半径是以 dBFS 计的电平（地面上的环），并非距离。只有一只扬声器承载的能量指向该扬声器。多只扬声器相干承载的能量指向它们之间、其幻象声像被听到的位置：约 700 Hz 以下沿其速度矢量，以上沿其能量矢量（Gerzon），宽度为能量矢量预测的听感宽度（Frank）。在扬声器之间相互抵消的能量没有稳定的方向：它扩散得很宽，并染为赭色。这是根据馈送信号的估算，并非测得的声场；顶部声道采用示意性的 45 度仰角。将指针悬停在能量体上，可读取某个方向的电平及其构成。";
"Frequency" = "频率";
"Frequency colors the full band by the bands heard from each direction, warm bass through cool treble: near the listener every audible band mixes, toward white for broadband sound, and toward the edge only the loudest bands remain. Theme draws it in the palette's color. A split into 3 or 5 bands always shows each band in its own color." = "“频率”按每个方向听到的各频段为全频段着色，低音偏暖、高音偏冷：靠近听者处所有可闻频段相互混合，宽带声音趋近白色；越靠近边缘，只剩下最响的频段。“主题”使用调色板的颜色。分为 3 或 5 个频段时，每个频段始终以自身的颜色显示。";
"Grain" = "颗粒";
"A fine, still grain in the glow, like the window's film grain. It moves only with the body." = "辉光中细腻而静止的颗粒，如同窗口背景的胶片颗粒。它只随形体移动。";
"Colored by frequency, a point of the body wears the hues of the bands that are at least that loud in its direction: the edge shows what dominates each direction, the core what all of them share." = "按频率着色时，形体上的每一点都带有在其方向上至少有那么响的频段的色相：边缘显示每个方向中占主导的频段，核心显示所有频段共有的部分。";
"centre %@" = "中心 %@";
"Its color shows the frequencies heard from each direction: near the listener every band mixes toward white, near the edge only the loudest bands remain, warm for bass and cool for treble." = "其颜色显示从每个方向听到的频率：靠近听者处所有频段混合并趋近白色，靠近边缘处只剩最响的频段，低音偏暖、高音偏冷。";
"Edge color: loudest band" = "边缘颜色：最响的频段";
"Radiant" = "辉光";
"Level body" = "电平能量体";
"Style" = "样式";
"Glow range" = "辉光范围";
"The hemisphere's grid." = "半球网格。";
"GLOW = LEVEL" = "辉光 = 电平";
"Glow = level" = "辉光 = 电平";
"loudest" = "最响";
"Blur" = "模糊";
"Particles" = "粒子";
"Particle size" = "粒子大小";
"How large a new particle is." = "新粒子的大小。";
"How bright the particles' light is." = "粒子光的亮度。";
"Each particle: a band, where it is heard" = "每个粒子：一个频段，在它被听到的位置";
"How many particles each band sends per analysis frame (30 a second), drawn from its frequencies in proportion to their energy, so a strong one gathers several into one bright bead. More fill the streaks and clouds; fewer leave single beads." = "每个频段在每个分析帧（每秒 30 帧）发出的粒子数，按其各频率的能量比例抽取，因此强的频率会聚成一颗明亮的光珠。越多，光带与云团越饱满；越少，越剩下一颗颗光珠。";
"How much particles smear as they age, so older light turns to haze while new particles stay crisp. 0 keeps them sharp." = "粒子随时间推移被抹开的程度：较旧的光化为薄雾，新粒子保持清晰。0 表示始终清晰。";
"How long particles stay, fading as they go; the longer, the more they build up into streaks and clouds." = "粒子停留并逐渐淡出的时间；越长，越会累积成光带与云团。";
"How far below the loudest band particles still glow, in dB: the loudest burn white, quieter ones fade out over this range. How loud the loudest band is sets how bright the whole glow is. Hover over a particle to read its band's level." = "粒子在最响频段之下多少 dB 内仍然发光：最响的燃成白色，较安静的在此范围内淡出。最响频段有多响决定整个辉光的亮度。将指针悬停在粒子上，可读取其频段的电平。";
"The quietest band drawn: a band below it sends no particles, whatever the glow range." = "绘制的最安静的频段：低于它的频段无论辉光范围如何都不发出粒子。";
"Frequency colors each band's particles by its frequency, warm bass through cool treble; where many bands meet, their light adds up toward white. Theme draws them in the palette's color. A split into 3 or 5 bands always shows each band in its own color." = "“频率”按各频段的频率为其粒子着色，低音偏暖、高音偏冷；许多频段相遇处，光叠加而趋近白色。“主题”使用调色板的颜色。分为 3 或 5 个频段时，每个频段始终以自身的颜色显示。";
"Each particle wears its band's color, warm for bass and cool for treble; where many bands meet, their light adds up toward white." = "每个粒子带有其频段的颜色，低音偏暖、高音偏冷；许多频段相遇处，光叠加而趋近白色。";
"Radiant draws each band as particles where its frequencies are heard: at the centre of gravity of the speakers that carry them, weighted by their level in each, so a centred phantom is a bright point between L and R and a wide stereo programme a streak along the line between them. The particles glow in their frequency's hue, as bright as they are loud, then fade and smear as they age. Level body draws the level heard from each direction as the radius of one body, read on the floor's dBFS rings." = "辉光把每个频段画成粒子，放在其频率被听到的位置：承载它们的扬声器的重心，按其在各扬声器中的电平加权；因此居中的幻象声像是 L 与 R 之间的一个亮点，宽阔的立体声节目是它们之间连线上的一条光带。粒子以其频率的色相发光，越响越亮，并随时间推移淡出、抹开。电平能量体把从每个方向听到的电平画成一个能量体的半径，用地面上的 dBFS 环读取。";
"Each particle is one of a band's frequencies in the newest analysis, where it is heard: at the centre of gravity of the speakers, weighted by its amplitude in each. A sound only one speaker carries sits at that speaker; one panned between speakers sits on the line between them where its gains put it, at every frequency; two sounds sharing a band each keep their own place; sound the speakers carry independently scatters along the lines between them, frequency by frequency. Energy that cancels between speakers is tinted ochre where it sits. An estimate from the feeds, not a measured sound field; height channels use a schematic 45 degree elevation. Hover over a particle to read its band, level and what places it there." = "每个粒子是最新一次分析中某个频段的一个频率，位于它被听到的位置：各扬声器的重心，按它在每只扬声器中的幅度加权。只有一只扬声器承载的声音位于该扬声器处；在扬声器之间声像定位的声音，在每个频率上都位于其增益所决定的连线位置；同一频段中的两个声音各自保持自己的位置；各扬声器独立承载的声音沿扬声器之间的连线逐个频率散开。在扬声器之间相互抵消的能量在其所在位置染为赭色。这是根据馈送信号的估算，并非测得的声场；顶部声道采用示意性的 45 度仰角。将指针悬停在粒子上，可读取其频段、电平以及使它位于该处的成分。";
"How readily speakers that share coherent energy count as one image. In Radiant it decides what reads as a phantom image or out of phase (the ochre tint and the pointer's reading), not where particles sit: their frequencies' amplitudes decide that. Coherence is measured from the speakers' smoothed cross-spectra and corrected for chance. The analysis uses it (in the plugin, too)." = "共享相干能量的扬声器被视为同一声像的难易程度。在辉光中，它决定哪些能量读作幻象声像或反相（赭色与指针读数），而不决定粒子的位置：位置由其频率的幅度决定。相干度由扬声器的平滑互谱测得，并校正了偶然相关。分析过程会使用此设置（插件中也是）。";
"This plugin sends no frequencies of its own (before build 87), so Radiant draws its particles from the spatial field's statistics. Install the plugins of this build to see each frequency where it is heard." = "此插件不发送自身的各个频率（build 87 之前），因此辉光根据空间场的统计数据绘制粒子。请安装本版本的插件，以便在每个频率被听到的位置看到它。";
"Particles of the speaker feeds' frequency bands, each where its band is heard: at the centre of gravity of the speakers that carry it, weighted by its level in each. A centred phantom is a bright point between two speakers, a wide stereo programme a streak along the line between them, sound all round gathers toward the listener. The loudest band glows white and quieter ones fade out %d dB below it; particles fade and smear as they age. Energy out of phase scatters and is tinted ochre. Height channels use a schematic 45 degree elevation." = "扬声器馈送信号各频段的粒子，每个位于其频段被听到的位置：承载它的扬声器的重心，按其在各扬声器中的电平加权。居中的幻象声像是两只扬声器之间的一个亮点，宽阔的立体声节目是它们之间连线上的一条光带，来自四周的声音向听者聚拢。最响的频段发出白光，较安静的在其下 %d dB 处淡出；粒子随时间推移淡出、抹开。反相的能量散开并染为赭色。顶部声道采用示意性的 45 度仰角。";
"Sparkle" = "闪光";
"How brightly new particles glint before they smoke into glow. 0 leaves only the glow." = "新粒子在化为光晕之前闪烁的亮度。0 表示只留下光晕。";

