"All readings cover the whole measurement since the last reset. Tonal balance, bandwidth and stereo image use the meter's live spectrum (128 bands, about 1/13 octave) and its five stereo bands, averaged in power over the moments with sound. DC offset and the energy below 20 Hz come from a signal-health meter in the analysis: each channel's 1 s mean, and a fourth-order 20 Hz low-pass after the drift is removed." = "所有读数涵盖上次重置以来的整个测量。音色平衡、带宽和立体声像使用本表的实时频谱（128 个频带，约 1/13 倍频程）和五个立体声频带，在有声音的时刻按功率平均。直流偏移和 20 Hz 以下的能量来自分析中的信号健康测量：每个声道的 1 s 平均值，以及去除漂移后经四阶 20 Hz 低通的能量。";
