"BS.1770 gated programme loudness, judged above against the standard." = "BS.1770 门限节目响度，已在上方按标准判定。";
"Balance" = "平衡";
"Bandwidth" = "带宽";
"Bass" = "低频";
"Bass correlation (below 120 Hz)" = "低频相关性（120 Hz 以下）";
"Below 30 Hz" = "30 Hz 以下";
"Breaks in the analysed audio; the readings span them." = "分析音频中的中断；读数跨越这些中断。";
"Brighter than most finished music, which falls about 3 to 6 dB per octave." = "比多数成品音乐更亮；成品音乐通常每倍频程下降约 3 至 6 dB。";
"Centred" = "居中";
"Correlation" = "相关性";
"Crest factor" = "峰值因数";
"Darker than most finished music, which falls about 3 to 6 dB per octave." = "比多数成品音乐更暗；成品音乐通常每倍频程下降约 3 至 6 dB。";
"Dropped frames" = "丢帧";
"Dynamics" = "动态";
"EBU Tech 3342 spread of short-term loudness: the programme's macro-dynamics. Under 3 LU reads as nearly constant." = "EBU Tech 3342 短期响度的分布范围，即节目的宏观动态。低于 3 LU 听起来几乎恒定。";
"ENERGY BY BAND, AGAINST THE WHOLE" = "各频段能量（相对整体）";
"Energy above 12 kHz against the whole. Much below −35 dB sounds closed-in." = "12 kHz 以上能量相对整体的比例。远低于 −35 dB 时听起来发闷。";
"Energy from 20 to 30 Hz against the whole. Much above −12 dB wastes headroom on what few systems reproduce." = "20 至 30 Hz 能量相对整体的比例。远高于 −12 dB 会把余量浪费在少数系统才能重放的内容上。";
"Energy of R against L over the session." = "整个会话中 R 相对 L 的能量。";
"Energy-weighted L/R phase correlation over the session. Below 0 parts of the mix cancel in mono." = "整个会话按能量加权的 L/R 相位相关性。低于 0 时混音的部分内容在单声道下会抵消。";
"Falls away above %@" = "%@ 以上衰减";
"From the last sound to the end of the measurement." = "从最后的声音到测量结束。";
"From the start of the measurement to the first sound above −70 LUFS." = "从测量开始到第一个高于 −70 LUFS 的声音。";
"Full-scale samples" = "满幅采样";
"HOW TO READ THIS REPORT" = "如何阅读本报告";
"High-frequency extent" = "高频延展";
"Highest inter-sample peak; the ceiling is %@ dBTP." = "最高采样间峰值；上限为 %@ dBTP。";
"Highest peak above the programme's mean RMS level." = "最高峰值高出节目平均 RMS 电平的量。";
"Highs" = "高频";
"Interruptions" = "中断";
"Leading silence" = "开头静音";
"Level change when L and R are summed to mono, from the session's correlation." = "L 与 R 合并为单声道时的电平变化，依据会话的相关性计算。";
"Level of 2 to 5 kHz against a line between its neighbours (1 to 2 kHz, 6 to 10 kHz). Above +3 dB it tends to sound harsh." = "2 至 5 kHz 相对其相邻频段（1 至 2 kHz、6 至 10 kHz）连线的电平。高于 +3 dB 时往往听起来刺耳。";
"Loudness & peaks" = "响度与峰值";
"Loudness range (LRA)" = "响度范围（LRA）";
"Low frequencies are best near mono (+0.7 and up) for vinyl, clubs and mono playback." = "低频最好接近单声道（+0.7 及以上），以适应黑胶、俱乐部和单声道重放。";
"Low mids" = "中低频";
"Low-end movement" = "低频起伏";
"Lowest correlation" = "最低相关性";
"Measured on L and R in Stereo." = "在立体声模式下对 L 和 R 测量。";
"Median of the 3 s true peak above short-term loudness: how much the transients stand out moment to moment." = "3 s 真峰值高出短期响度的中位数：瞬态随时突出的程度。";
"Mono fold-down" = "单声道折叠";
"NOTE" = "留意";
"Narrow peaks standing more than 5 dB above the average spectrum's half-octave trend, held over the session." = "在整个会话中持续高出平均频谱半倍频程趋势 5 dB 以上的窄峰。";
"No steep loss up to %@." = "直到 %@ 都没有急剧衰减。";
"None" = "无";
"Nothing measured yet." = "尚未测量。";
"OK" = "良好";
"OK meets the rule beside it. NOTE is worth a listen: the reading is outside what most finished masters show, which can be intended. CHECK needs attention before delivery. Loudness and true peak are judged against the chosen standard; every other rule is mastering guidance, not a specification." = "“良好”表示符合旁边的规则。“留意”值得试听：读数超出多数成品母带的常见范围，可能是有意为之。“检查”需在交付前处理。响度和真峰值依据所选标准判定；其余规则均为母带处理建议，并非规范。";
"Peak to loudness (PLR)" = "峰值与响度比（PLR）";
"Peak to short-term (PSR)" = "峰值与短期响度比（PSR）";
"Readings that touched 0 dBFS, where a converter or a lossy encoder is likely to clip." = "触及 0 dBFS 的读数，此时转换器或有损编码器很可能削波。";
"Resonances" = "共振";
"Separate overshoots above 0 dBTP." = "各次独立的超过 0 dBTP 的过冲。";
"Side share of the energy, in percent: 0 is mono, 50 is unrelated channels. Above 45 the centre may feel hollow." = "侧声道占能量的百分比：0 为单声道，50 为互不相关的声道。高于 45 时中心可能显得空洞。";
"Signal integrity" = "信号完整性";
"Spectral tilt" = "频谱倾斜";
"Spread (10th to 95th percentile) of the level below 120 Hz. Little movement suggests heavy low-end compression." = "120 Hz 以下电平的分布范围（第 10 至第 95 百分位）。起伏很小意味着低频压缩较重。";
"Stereo image" = "立体声像";
"Sub" = "超低频";
"The sample rate stops the analysis at %@." = "采样率使分析止于 %@。";
"The worst one percent of the session's moments." = "会话中最差的百分之一时刻。";
"Tonal balance" = "音色平衡";
"Trailing silence" = "结尾静音";
"True peak" = "真峰值";
"True peak above integrated loudness. Below 8 LU the master is densely limited; below 6 LU transients are usually flattened." = "真峰值高出积分响度的量。低于 8 LU 表示母带限制很重；低于 6 LU 时瞬态通常被压平。";
"True-peak overs" = "真峰值过载";
"Upper mids" = "中高频";
"Upper-mid presence" = "中高频临场感";
"Width" = "宽度";
"Within the 3 to 6 dB per octave fall of most finished music." = "处于多数成品音乐每倍频程下降 3 至 6 dB 的范围内。";
"The largest channel's mean over the session. Above −60 dBFS it costs headroom and can click at edits; above −46 dBFS (0.5 percent) remove it with a high-pass." = "会话中最大声道的平均值。高于 −60 dBFS 会占用余量，并可能在剪辑处产生咔嗒声；高于 −46 dBFS（百分之 0.5）请用高通去除。";
"DC offset" = "直流偏移";
"Below 20 Hz" = "20 Hz 以下";
"This plugin does not measure it. Install the plugins of build 90 or later." = "此插件不测量该项。请安装构建 90 或更高版本的插件。";
"Energy from about 2 to 20 Hz (rumble, wind, subsonic oscillation) against the programme's full-band energy, LFE left out. Above −25 dB it eats headroom no speaker turns into sound; a strong 30 to 40 Hz bass reads a little here too." = "约 2 至 20 Hz 的能量（隆隆声、风噪、次声振荡）相对节目全频带能量的比例，不含 LFE。高于 −25 dB 会占用扬声器无法还原成声音的余量；很强的 30 至 40 Hz 低频也会在此略有读数。";

